Package 105: the shipping-config TCP tester really dials (St02 H-008), GPIB remote START per golden through
W906_RemoteRunStart and STOP really pauses (H-012, with the fix for its fMotorTest NULL read), safe-door open / close
records and the [O18] last-open time per golden (RecordSafeDoorStates), the cooling fan per golden (SIM config only).

21 files: NEW 3 (tests/test_coolfan_rules.cpp, test_safedoor_record.cpp, test_tcp_tester_real.cpp), OLD 18 (machine had
an older laptop version, taken as is), LOCAL 0. Nothing under tools/vscode-htdesigner. o2: wb_serve + 5 tests build,
PE 32/32 complete; ctest CoolFan_Rules / TesterComm_TcpTesterReal / TesterComm_Handler / SafeDoorRecord / VacuumVc8 /
MachineIoTable_HT9050 / IoPoints_HT9050 / MachineSuckers_HT9050 pass; production_audit unchanged.
Line endings: package 105 arrived LF (every earlier package, and this tree, is CRLF); the 21 files are stored CRLF as
before -- content byte-identical to the package apart from CR, so later packages still classify them by normalized MD5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
